@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@accessToken = GANTI_DENGAN_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Login (refresh token otomatis disimpan sebagai cookie HttpOnly)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@tbpermata.local",
  "password": "PASSWORD_DARI_ENV"
}

### Profil login
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Refresh access token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh

### Daftar cabang
GET {{baseUrl}}/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Tambah cabang
POST {{baseUrl}}/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "CBG-02",
  "name": "TB Permata Keramik Cabang 2",
  "address": "Alamat cabang"
}

### Tambah user
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager.cabang2@tbpermata.local",
  "password": "ganti-password-kuat",
  "fullName": "Manager Cabang 2",
  "roleCode": "MANAGER",
  "branchId": "UUID_CABANG"
}

### Audit log
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs?page=1&limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Daftar kategori produk
GET {{baseUrl}}/product-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Daftar satuan
GET {{baseUrl}}/units
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Tambah produk (gunakan UUID kategori dan satuan dari endpoint di atas)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "KER-KOB-ANDARA-BEIGE-3030",
  "name": "Kobin Andara Beige 30x30",
  "brand": "Kobin",
  "productType": "KERAMIK",
  "categoryId": "UUID_KATEGORI_KERAMIK",
  "baseUnitId": "UUID_SATUAN_DUS",
  "taxPercentage": 11,
  "barcode": "899000000001"
}

### Cari produk; hasil dipaginasi agar tetap ringan untuk puluhan ribu produk
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?search=andara&page=1&limit=30&branchId=UUID_CABANG
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Tambah satuan jual alternatif, contoh 1 dus berisi 4 pcs bila satuan dasar PCS
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/UUID_PRODUK/units
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": "UUID_SATUAN_DUS",
  "conversionToBase": 4,
  "isDefaultSale": true,
  "barcode": "899000000002"
}

### Tetapkan harga ecer/grosir per cabang secara atomik
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/UUID_PRODUK/prices/UUID_CABANG
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tiers": [
    { "productUnitId": "UUID_UNIT_JUAL", "minQuantity": 1, "sellPrice": 45000 },
    { "productUnitId": "UUID_UNIT_JUAL", "minQuantity": 100, "sellPrice": 43000 },
    { "productUnitId": "UUID_UNIT_JUAL", "minQuantity": 500, "sellPrice": 41000 }
  ]
}

### Harga modal per cabang (tidak dapat dibaca kasir)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/UUID_PRODUK/costs/UUID_CABANG
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitCost": 36000
}
